<title>USA: Bio-Vascular Inc Q4 Oct 31 net lower.</title>
<headline>Bio-Vascular Inc Q4 Oct 31 net lower.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr		  $  0.03		  $  0.08</p>
<p> Oper net			320			736</p>
<p> Revs			  2,266		    3,380</p>
<p> Avg shrs		    9,465		    8,888</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q4 net excludes a loss from discontinued operations of $154,000 or $0.02 a share and a loss on disposal of Vital Images operations of $1.3 million or $0.14 a share.  </p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 Q4 net excludes a gain from discontinued operations of $853,000 or $0.10 a share.</p>
<p>	     12 MONTHS</p>
