<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q4 net excludes a loss from discontinued operations of $1.05 million or $0.11 a share and loss on disposal of Vital Images of $1.3 million or $0.14 a share.  </p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 12 months net excludes a gain from discontinued operations of $526,000 or $0.06 a share.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312 408 8787</p>
